The files in this directory are practice-exercise content (questions, and any
images they reference) downloaded from OpenStax Exercises
(https://exercises.openstax.org) by the shared toolchain's
tools/cnxml2tex/fetch_exercises.py, and committed here so the book always builds
offline.

Copyright: each exercise names its holders in the `copyright_holders` field of
its JSON file (Rice University, in every file examined on 2026-11-26).

Licence: the downloaded JSON carries no licence field. OpenStax Exercises states
at https://exercises.openstax.org/copyright (read 2026-11-26) that its content is
copyright Rice University or used with permission, that many of its questions
are licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution licence, and that each
question carries its own copyright and licensing information. Treat these files
under those terms, and under no terms broader than the licence of the book they
belong to, which that book's collection XML declares (the per-book table is in
tasks/reference/openstax/book-inventory.md at the root of this repository).

See ../CLAUDE.md (the OpenStax family contract) for how downloaded content is
licensed and cached.
